<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it started coverage of Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 42-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
